'''Sicania''' ({{IPA|scn|sɪˈkanja}}) is an island [[Regions of Balisca|region]] of the [[Hesperia|Hesperian]] [[Communities of Balisca|community]] of [[Balisca]], located in the [[Mistral Sea]]. It is the fourth-largest island in the [[Baliscan archipelago]] and lies west of the island of [[Pindorama]] and immediately north of [[Atlántida]]. In December 2023, it was estimated to have a population of 349,465. 

